OL,3,GNEWSAJobs saved as Bernard Matthews
OL,4,Asite stays open
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of jobs at a major food
OL,7,Ffactory in Derby have been saved after
OL,8,Fthe owners reversed a decision to close
OL,9,Fthe facility.
OL,11,FBernard Matthews Foods said in August
OL,12,Fit was shutting its processing facility
OL,13,Fon Shaftesbury Street South by the end
OL,14,Fof 2026, with about 600 jobs affected.
OL,16,FHowever, on Thursday, 2 Sisters Food
OL,17,FGroup - whose founder bought Bernard
OL,18,FMatthews in 2016 - said a "new anchor
OL,19,Fcustomer" had been found, with about
OL,20,F400 jobs now secure and "100 to 150
OL,21,Froles remaining at risk of redundancy".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
