OL,3,GNEWSAJobs saved as Bernard Matthews
OL,4,Asite stays open
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaggy Shanker, MP for Derby South, said
OL,7,Fthe development was "a huge relief for
OL,8,Fhundreds of workers and their families,
OL,9,Fand positive news for Derby".
